I've left out the `http-client` import and the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/notifier@0.1.0`, and a fetch would send digest text to an external host, which is outside that grant. The output would not change, but the request would still reach a host the node was never authorized to contact. The `with` clause and the approval note conflict, so the grant needs to be updated in the graph definition before this call can be added.

